{
  "h": 560,
  "html": "<title>Cost & funding calculator</title>\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;padding:18px 20px;font:14px/1.4 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f;background:#fff}\nh1{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px}\n.sub{color:#666;margin:0 0 14px;font-size:12.5px}\n.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr 70px;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:6px 0}\n.row b{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\ninput[type=range]{width:100%}\n.big{display:flex;gap:16px;margin:16px 0 10px}\n.big div{flex:1;background:#f6f5f2;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px}\n.big span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#666}\n.big strong{font-size:22px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{display:flex;height:26px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin:4px 0 2px;background:#eee}\n.bar i{display:block;height:100%}\n.lbl{font-size:12.5px;color:#444;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\n.key{font-size:12px;color:#555;margin:2px 0 10px}\n.key em{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin:0 4px 0 10px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.note{font-size:11.5px;color:#777;margin-top:10px}\n</style>\n<h1>Can donations keep it running?</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">Monthly cost vs revenue on a Cloudflare-first stack. Drag to test the assumptions.</p>\n<div class=\"row\"><label>Monthly active users</label><input id=\"mau\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"33\"><b id=\"mauv\"></b></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><label>Users who donate</label><input id=\"dp\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.5\"><b id=\"dpv\"></b></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><label>Average donation / mo</label><input id=\"da\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\"><b id=\"dav\"></b></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><label>Users on $4 Premium</label><input id=\"pp\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\"><b id=\"ppv\"></b></div>\n<div class=\"big\"><div><span>Monthly cost</span><strong id=\"cost\"></strong></div><div><span>Monthly revenue</span><strong id=\"rev\"></strong></div><div><span>Covered</span><strong id=\"cov\"></strong></div><div><span>Given back / mo</span><strong id=\"sur\"></strong></div></div>\n<div class=\"lbl\"><span>Cost</span><span id=\"costl\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"bar\" id=\"cbar\"></div>\n<div class=\"key\"><em style=\"background:#d9774b\"></em>Servers &amp; media<em style=\"background:#e8b48f\"></em>Safety staff<em style=\"background:#bbb\"></em>Base</div>\n<div class=\"lbl\"><span>Revenue</span><span id=\"revl\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"bar\" id=\"rbar\"></div>\n<div class=\"key\"><em style=\"background:#3d7dd8\"></em>Donations<em style=\"background:#8fb5ea\"></em>Premium<em style=\"background:#4f9e6b\"></em>5% creator fees</div>\n<p id=\"pitch\" style=\"font-size:15px;margin:12px 0 0\"></p>\n<p class=\"note\">Estimates, not quotes. Infra about 3.2&cent;/user/mo (R2 storage 0.5 GB/user, self-encoded video, Workers, Postgres, moderation ML). Safety staff about 2.4&cent;/user (1 moderator per 250k users at $6k/mo). $500/mo base. Creator fees assume 0.5% of users earn $100/mo.</p>\n<script>\nfunction $(id){return document.getElementById(id)}\nfunction money(n){return n>=1e6?'$'+(n/1e6).toFixed(2)+'M':n>=1e4?'$'+Math.round(n/1e3)+'k':'$'+Math.round(n).toLocaleString()}\nfunction num(n){return n>=1e6?(n/1e6).toFixed(1)+'M':n>=1e3?Math.round(n/1e3)+'k':String(n)}\nfunction seg(parts,max){return parts.map(function(p){return '<i style=\"width:'+(100*p[0]/max)+'%;background:'+p[1]+'\"></i>'}).join('')}\nfunction draw(){\n var mau=Math.round(Math.pow(10,4+3*$('mau').value/100)/1000)*1000;\n var dp=+$('dp').value, da=+$('da').value, pp=+$('pp').value;\n $('mauv').textContent=num(mau); $('dpv').textContent=dp.toFixed(1)+'%'; $('dav').textContent='$'+da; $('ppv').textContent=pp.toFixed(1)+'%';\n var infra=0.0315*mau, staff=0.024*mau, base=500, cost=infra+staff+base;\n var don=mau*dp/100*da, prem=mau*pp/100*4, fees=mau*0.025, rev=don+prem+fees;\n var max=Math.max(cost,rev);\n $('cost').textContent=money(cost); $('rev').textContent=money(rev); $('cov').textContent=Math.round(100*rev/cost)+'%';\n $('sur').textContent=money(Math.max(0,rev-cost));\n $('cov').style.color=rev>=cost?'#2f7d4a':'#b4462a';\n $('costl').textContent=(100*cost/mau).toFixed(1)+'¢ per user';\n $('revl').textContent=(100*rev/mau).toFixed(1)+'¢ per user';\n $('cbar').innerHTML=seg([[infra,'#d9774b'],[staff,'#e8b48f'],[base,'#bbb']],max);\n $('rbar').innerHTML=seg([[don,'#3d7dd8'],[prem,'#8fb5ea'],[fees,'#4f9e6b']],max);\n var need=Math.ceil(cost/da), oneIn=Math.max(1,Math.round(mau/need));\n var p=$('pitch'); p.textContent='';\n var b=document.createElement('b'); b.textContent='1 in '+oneIn+' users giving $'+da+'/mo';\n p.appendChild(b); p.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' covers the whole bill on donations alone.'));\n}\n['mau','dp','da','pp'].forEach(function(id){$(id).addEventListener('input',draw)});\ndraw();\n</script>\n",
  "type": "html",
  "w": 860,
  "x": 24,
  "y": 1600
}
